{{!--
    Tag landing (#125): a tag page as a mini-series landing, on the same skeleton as the
    WC homepage and the Luminous landing: brand band (backdrop bleeding behind the nav),
    hero, thick rule, services row, then a rule above the list.

    Call inside {{#tag}} when the tag has art or a description (tag.hbs decides).
    By content: each row appears only when its content exists in Ghost Admin.
      hero          art as the h1, or the name as text   (tag feature_image / name)
      description   tag description, no site fallback     (blurbText)
      listen links  the parent show's (Wonder Cabinet)    (@custom.*_link)
      About         a Show About page carrying this tag    (components/show-about)
    Spec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-21-tag-landing-design.md
--}}
{{#contentFor "body_class"}} wc-landing{{/contentFor}}

<div class="wc-brand-band">
    <div class="wc-hero-zone">
        {{> "components/tag-header" landing=true}}
    </div>

    <hr class="wc-rule wc-rule--thick">

    {{> "components/show-services" blurbText=description apple=@custom.apple_podcasts_link spotify=@custom.spotify_link youtube=@custom.youtube_music_link aboutTag=slug}}
</div>

<hr class="wc-rule">
